---
title: Diario GDR - Entity (MVP)
---
classDiagram
    direction TB

    class AbstractAuditable {
        <<abstract>>
        String createdBy
        String updatedBy
        Instant createdAt
        Instant updatedAt
        Long version
    }

    class AppUser {
        UUID id
        String keycloakId
        String email
        Map settings
        boolean premium
    }

    class GameCharacter {
        UUID id
        String name
        String description
        String campaignName
        String backgroundColor
        GameCharacterKind kind
    }

    class GameCharacterKind {
        <<enumeration>>
        PLAYER
        GAME_MASTER
    }

    class Diary {
        UUID id
        String title
        String description
        String coverColor
        String font
        Short fontSize
    }

    class DiaryPage {
        UUID id
        Short pageNumber
        Map content
    }

    class Document {
        UUID id
        String name
        Long size
        String mimeType
        String bucket
        String objectKey
    }

    AbstractAuditable <|-- AppUser
    AbstractAuditable <|-- GameCharacter
    AbstractAuditable <|-- Diary
    AbstractAuditable <|-- DiaryPage
    AbstractAuditable <|-- Document

    GameCharacter "0..*" --> "1" AppUser : owner_id
    Diary "0..*" --> "1" GameCharacter : character_id
    DiaryPage "0..*" --> "1" Diary : diary_id
    AppUser "0..*" --> "0..1" Document : avatar_document_id
    GameCharacter "0..*" --> "0..1" Document : avatar_document_id
    Diary "0..*" --> "0..1" Document : cover_document_id
    GameCharacter ..> GameCharacterKind : kind

    note for AbstractAuditable "Tutte le entity la estendono: contiene solo audit e version. L'id sta in ogni entity. createdBy e updatedBy sono il sub del token in testo, senza chiave esterna."
    note for DiaryPage "page_number da 1 a 100, unico per diario (vincolo rimandabile). content e il JSON di Tiptap (jsonb)."
    note for Diary "font e fontSize null: si usano le impostazioni dell'utente."
    note for GameCharacter "kind si sceglie alla creazione e non si cambia."
    note for AppUser "settings null nel database: si usano i default del frontend."
    note for Document "Il file sta nello storage S3 (SeaweedFS in locale), bucket privato. bucket e objectKey non escono mai nei DTO."
